rem A multi-line JSON literal waits for its closing bracket, the same way a
rem block waits for its terminator. It did not until 2026-09-11: the literal
rem was refused on its first line, so JSON could not be typed at the prompt.
cfg@ = {
  "name": "phosphor",
  "tags": [
    "basic",
    "embeddable"
  ]
}
println json_gets$(cfg@, "name")
println json_len(json_get@(cfg@, "tags"))
bad@ = { 1: 2 }
println "recovered"
